        "## 11. Select and Evaluate `(7 pts)`\n",
        "\n",
        "1. Create a `SelectFromModel` named `sfm` that uses the trained `rf`. Get the **names** of the selected features as a list, save it as `cols_embedded`, and print it. `(3 pts)`\n",
        "2. Create a `LogisticRegression(max_iter=1000)` named `model_embedded`, train it on `X_train[cols_embedded]`, predict `X_test[cols_embedded]` as `pred_embedded`, and save the accuracy as `acc_embedded`. Print it. `(4 pts)`\n",
        "\n",
        "*Hint: `SelectFromModel(rf, prefit=True)` (`prefit=True` = the model is already trained), then `sfm.get_support()`.*"
